**/raw/
**/interim/
**/processed/

# Common data formats (block everywhere)
**/*.csv
**/*.tsv
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.parquet
**/*.feather
**/*.sav
**/*.dta
**/*.rds
**/*.pkl
**/*.pickle
**/*.h5
**/*.hdf5
**/*.mat
**/*.nii
**/*.nii.gz
**/*.txt
**/*.json

